WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.050 --> 00:00:05.249
One settings file per stage holds every
value the commands need: the tenant,

2
00:00:05.249 --> 00:00:08.687
the cloud, the identities,
the operators, the pilot,

3
00:00:08.687 --> 00:00:12.125
the synthetic objects, the
policies and the rings.

4
00:00:12.125 --> 00:00:15.038
Before any command
runs, the kit checks it.

5
00:00:15.038 --> 00:00:17.705
A secret, or anything that looks like one,

6
00:00:17.705 --> 00:00:21.425
stops the run, and so does a
placeholder nobody replaced.

7
00:00:21.425 --> 00:00:23.675
The pilot's owner can't be an operator.

8
00:00:23.675 --> 00:00:25.945
The file must be for the
stage you're running,

9
00:00:25.945 --> 00:00:29.412
and the smoke-test group managed
account must follow the standard.

10
00:00:29.412 --> 00:00:32.273
Reads sign in as an
app with a certificate,

11
00:00:32.273 --> 00:00:35.350
writes as a person, and
nothing uses a secret.
